     2| * IVX Autonomous Proof Diagnostics API (owner-only).
     3| *
     4| *   GET  /api/ivx/autonomous-proof  → SHA parity diagnostics card data
     5| *
     6| * Returns real-time diagnostics for the "IVX Autonomous Proof" card:
     7| *   - Current backend commit SHA (from /health)
     8| *   - GitHub main HEAD SHA
     9| *   - Render deploy SHA + last deployment timestamp
    10| *   - /health SHA + /version SHA
    11| *   - Last autonomous worker job ID + status
    12| *   - Four-way SHA parity result + verified indicator
    13| *
    14| * HONESTY RULES:
    15| *   - Every SHA is fetched live from its real source.
    16| *   - If a source is unreachable, its value is null (never fabricated).
    17| *   - The verified indicator is true ONLY when all four SHAs match.
    18| */
    19|import { assertIVXOwnerOnly, ownerOnlyJson, ownerOnlyOptions } from './owner-only';
